{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2017-08", "window": 1, "start_date": 1501545600, "end_date": 1502150399, "month_true_total": 75, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:13:27 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "34089270", "author": {"steamid": "76561198044766554", "personaname": "Skullblossom", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198044766554/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 11555, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 10451, "last_played": 1585788245, "avatar": "89fa4862dcd7e62c3426f53d9a66fc0ce7da3fe5"}, "language": "english", "review": "A deadly, rock-hard game I've dumped hours into in absurd marathon sessions that were some of the best game experiences I've ever had. Buy it. This one's a keeper.", "timestamp_created": 1502138507, "timestamp_updated": 1502138507, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "34072914", "author": {"steamid": "76561198059812220", "personaname": "CaptainRyku", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198059812220/", "num_games_owned": 251, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 1634, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 957, "last_played": 1591591882, "avatar": "9912a3035495d8758e8fd80485e9f8ed00f6f1c3"}, "language": "english", "review": "Risk of Rain is a little irritating at first, but if you keep playing and can accept death when it comes for you, you'll have an amazing time. I'm constantly shortening my runs and doing better each time. The game gets better the more you play it, the artifacts you can collect really spice it up as well.", "timestamp_created": 1502071432, "timestamp_updated": 1502071432, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "34070180", "author": {"steamid": "76561197978891314", "personaname": "Spymac", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/spymac/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 631, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 487, "last_played": 1402432962, "avatar": "79d3fe5839617eb83a9661071ed021dd56ac8a5b"}, "language": "english", "review": "I like it", "timestamp_created": 1502058483, "timestamp_updated": 1502058483, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.472440958023071289", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "34069316", "author": {"steamid": "76561197983645480", "personaname": "Anthagonas", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Anthagonas/", "num_games_owned": 484, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 3881, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3721, "last_played": 1591355720, "avatar": "45a8ea87b5b23f275e29a410d05a339c72db5d6e"}, "language": "english", "review": "I rarely write reviews, but this game totally deserves it.\nI may only have ~60 h gameplay, but I tried playing solo, I went hunting achievements, and god I played multiplayer.\nTHIS GAME IS AWESOME GUYS.\nMaps are not randomly generated, but they are randomly choosen, they are huge enough not to feel locked in one place vs hundred of monsters.\nBossfights are REALLY good, but I could use some more bosses.\nDifficulty can be really overwhelming but if it is really too hard try the multiplayer, community is really nice and I really liked playing with random people.\n10/10 would buy, 15/10 would buy if you have friends to play with", "timestamp_created": 1502055464, "timestamp_updated": 1502055464, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "34062939", "author": {"steamid": "76561198011405998", "personaname": "BubonicSlam", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/KeepTRolling/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 2784, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2380, "last_played": 1502025624, "avatar": "f4f17a4b7d1d12150503eefde2831e842690a196"}, "language": "english", "review": "one of the best rogue-like game 4 me", "timestamp_created": 1502034831, "timestamp_updated": 1502034831, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}